# ⚒️ AETHERIA — BLACKSMITH & EQUIPMENT CRAFTING SYSTEM

## 1. OVERVIEW

Blacksmith System adalah fasilitas di **Town Square** yang digunakan untuk membuat Equipment.

Blacksmith terhubung langsung dengan:

```text
Town Square
      ↓
Blacksmith Facility
      ↓
Inventory System
      ↓
Resource & Currency System
      ↓
Equipment Database
      ↓
Equipment Instance
```

Blacksmith memiliki 5 Level Crafting:

```text
BLACKSMITH LV.1
      ↓
IRON

BLACKSMITH LV.2
      ↓
STEEL

BLACKSMITH LV.3
      ↓
DAMASCUS

BLACKSMITH LV.4
      ↓
MITHRIL

BLACKSMITH LV.5
      ↓
EPIC
```

Equipment:

```text
IRON
  ↓
STEEL
  ↓
DAMASCUS
  ↓
MITHRIL
  ↓
EPIC
  ↓
LEGEND
  ↓
MYTHICAL
```

Namun:

```text
BLACKSMITH NORMAL CRAFT
IRON → STEEL → DAMASCUS → MITHRIL → EPIC
```

Sedangkan:

```text
LEGEND
MYTHICAL
```

tidak dapat dibuat melalui normal crafting.

