# 21. CRAFTING SUCCESS SYSTEM

Crafting normal memiliki:

```text
SUCCESS
FAIL
```

Default:

```text
IRON      : 100%
STEEL     : 100%
DAMASCUS  : 100%
MITHRIL   : 95%
EPIC      : 90%
```

Jika gagal:

```text
Material  → Consumed
Gold      → Consumed
Equipment → Not Created
```

Tidak ada equipment rusak karena equipment belum berhasil dibuat.

