# 41. CRAFTING VALIDATION LOGIC

Pseudo-code:

```text
function canCraft(recipe, blacksmith, inventory):

    if blacksmith.status != ACTIVE:
        return false

    if blacksmith.level < recipe.requiredFacilityLevel:
        return false

    if inventory.gold < recipe.requiredGold:
        return false

    for material in recipe.requiredMaterials:

        if inventory[material.id] < material.quantity:
            return false

    return true
```

