# 42. CRAFTING EXECUTION LOGIC

```text
function craft(recipe):

    if !canCraft(recipe):
        return CRAFT_DENIED

    consumeGold(recipe.requiredGold)

    consumeMaterials(
        recipe.requiredMaterials
    )

    addCraftingQueue(recipe)

    return CRAFTING_STARTED
```

Setelah order diproses:

```text
function completeCraft(order):

    rng = random(0,100)

    if rng <= order.successRate:

        equipment =
            generateEquipmentInstance(
                order.recipe.equipmentTemplateID
            )

        inventory.add(equipment)

        order.status = COMPLETED

    else:

        order.status = FAILED
```

